  "rules": [
    "Hold PBE/GAPW/cc-pVQZ, geometry, print precision and all other settings fixed. Translate the fixed geometry to the center when varying only the finite cell size.",
    "One native CPU, MPI rank and OMP thread per runner; no swap or retry. Require each fixed cgroup cap plus 2 GiB effective host reserve and 10 GiB scratch free.",
    "Check conditioning at every measured input. Compare original signed CUBE directly on equal grids or centered aligned crop; on changed CUTOFF apply both 4- and 6-point interpolations and require both to pass.",
    "For a cell increase also measure outer 1 angstrom boundary shells and omitted absolute density, with separate 0.001 electron screens.",
    "Repeat the exact G2 QZ input per track and log same-input CUBE digest equality separately. A failed endpoint or unavailable evidence keeps the QZ reference and A04 contract unfrozen.",
    "This diagnostic neither changes AV04 nor substitutes for combined refined settings, independent physical validation, architecture checks or production qualification."
